<BaseLayout title="Contact" path="/contact" description="Reach Joe Neiman about dealerships, airplanes, early-stage companies, speaking, or Merici.">
  <h1>Contact</h1>

  <p class="lede">The short version of what belongs in my inbox:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>A franchise dealership for sale, or a seller who'd rather skip the public listing.</li>
    <li>An airplane worth a look.</li>
    <li>An early-stage company in health and wellness, marketplaces, or transportation.</li>
    <li>A speaking invitation where real stories are welcome.</li>
    <li>Anything Merici-related.</li>
  </ul>

  <p>
    <mark class="pending">Contact method TBD: dedicated address like joe@joeneiman.com vs a form. Decide with Joe, do not publish his personal Gmail.</mark>
  </p>

  <div class="wf-note">Wireframe note: inbound here eventually routes through the triage system, so everything qualified reaches Joe with the homework already attached.</div>
</BaseLayout>
